{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/extras/wlnow.png?t=1745176706\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lead the Invasion. Conquer the Galaxy. Learn from Your Mistakes. (Or Don't.)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zyx empire is rising again! Now, it's your job to invade planets, harvest resources, and strategically obliterate any species standing in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Outsmart your enemies by predicting their next move!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/extras/simplescreenrecorder-2025-04-15_14.00.19online-video-cutter.com1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745176706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission drops you into enemy territory. Your job? <strong>Land, scout, extract resources, and analyze enemy behavior</strong> - all while staying alive for 20 turns <i>or</i> ensuring the opposition doesn\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build infrastructure during missions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1_.gif?t=1745176706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 missions (12 procedurally generated, 3 boss fights). Plus, there are occasional extra missions on normal and hard difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulty levels - hard mode unlocks after completing normal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ enemy unit types, each with 4 variants that scale in strength. Stronger enemies appear on hard difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of tower defense and turn-based strategy. Build turrets, extract minerals, and fight off waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ironman Mode only. Every decision counts. No take-backs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique combat mechanics. Predict enemy movement - you don\u2019t shoot <i>at</i> them, you shoot where they <i>will be</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616580?t=1745176706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616580?t=1745176706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/0b4653f3629e776b406267092f780ff898304313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745176706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/0b4653f3629e776b406267092f780ff898304313/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745176706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3645740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/extras/wlnow.png?t=1745176706\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lead the Invasion. Conquer the Galaxy. Learn from Your Mistakes. (Or Don't.)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zyx empire is rising again! Now, it's your job to invade planets, harvest resources, and strategically obliterate any species standing in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Outsmart your enemies by predicting their next move!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616580/extras/simplescreenrecorder-2025-04-15_14.00.19online-video-cutter.com1-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745176706\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission drops you into enemy territory. Your job? <strong>Lan